### ==============================================================================
### Nexacro EMS API Simulation Platform - Data Retrieval HTTP Collection
###
### Protocol: Nexacro Platform XML Wire Format
### (http://www.nexacroplatform.com/platform/dataset)
###
### Only Business Data Retrieval APIs are included (Logging & Config excluded).
###
### Can be executed directly with:
### - VS Code REST Client extension
### - IntelliJ / JetBrains HTTP Client
### - HTTPie / curl
###
### Default Port: 9000 (matching production Nexacro EMS backend port)
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000
@xmlContentType = application/xml; charset=utf-8
@jsonContentType = application/json
@userId = 658359
@orgId = 28753
@language = EN

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. HEALTH & PLATFORM MANAGEMENT APIS (JSON)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 0.1 Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 0.2 List All Registered Data Retrieval Endpoints (12 Endpoints)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/endpoints

### 0.3 Get Endpoint Schema & Execution Details (Stock Status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/endpoints/spare_parts.stock_status.search

### 0.4 List Reusable Dataset Schemas
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/datasets

### 0.5 List Configured Simulation Scenarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/scenarios

### 0.6 Toggle Scenario (Enable/Disable empty scenario)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/scenarios/toggle
Content-Type: {{jsonContentType}}

{
  "scenario_id": "spare_parts.stock_status.search.empty",
  "enabled": true
}

### 0.7 View Execution Audit Logs (Duration, Scenarios, Status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/logs?limit=20


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. SPARE PARTS & INVENTORY DOMAIN (DATA RETRIEVAL)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Search Stock Status (RetStockStatusList)
# XML Request & XML Response returning ds_result with onhand & available quantities
POST {{baseUrl}}/emsspareparts/sp101/sp110Nav/RetStockStatusList.lgdn
Content-Type: {{xmlContentType}}
Accept: {{xmlContentType}}

<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Root xmlns="http://www.nexacroplatform.com/platform/dataset">
    <Parameters>
        <Parameter id="_ems_userId" type="string">{{userId}}</Parameter>
        <Parameter id="_ems_organizationId" type="string">{{orgId}}</Parameter>
        <Parameter id="_ems_language" type="string">{{language}}</Parameter>
    </Parameters>
    <Dataset id="ds_search">
        <ColumnInfo>
            <Column id="organizationId" type="STRING" size="256"/>
            <Column id="itemId" type="STRING" size="256"/>
            <Column id="commonFlag" type="STRING" size="256"/>
            <Column id="periodicFlag" type="STRING" size="256"/>
            <Column id="itemDesc" type="STRING" size="256"/>
            <Column id="maker" type="STRING" size="256"/>
            <Column id="vendorName" type="STRING" size="256"/>
            <Column id="itemCond" type="STRING" size="256"/>
            <Column id="userId" type="STRING" size="256"/>
            <Column id="model" type="STRING" size="256"/>
            <Column id="optimizeFlag" type="STRING" size="256"/>
        </ColumnInfo>
        <Rows>
            <Row>
                <Col id="organizationId">{{orgId}}</Col>
                <Col id="itemId"></Col>
                <Col id="commonFlag"></Col>
                <Col id="periodicFlag"></Col>
                <Col id="itemDesc"></Col>
                <Col id="maker"></Col>
                <Col id="vendorName"></Col>
                <Col id="itemCond">Y</Col>
                <Col id="userId">{{userId}}</Col>
                <Col id="model"></Col>
                <Col id="optimizeFlag">Y</Col>
            </Row>
        </Rows>
    </Dataset>
    <Dataset id="ds_ItemInfo">
        <ColumnInfo>
            <Column id="item" type="STRING" size="256"/>
            <Column id="itemDesc" type="STRING" size="256"/>
            <Column id="inventoryItemId" type="STRING" size="256"/>
            <Column id="remark" type="STRING" size="256"/>
        </ColumnInfo>
        <Rows>
            <Row>
                <Col id="item">QCAB10960</Col>
                <Col id="itemDesc"></Col>
                <Col id="inventoryItemId"></Col>
                <Col id="remark"></Col>
            </Row>
            <Row>
                <Col id="item">QDAB03583</Col>
                <Col id="itemDesc"></Col>
                <Col id="inventoryItemId"></Col>
                <Col id="remark"></Col>
            </Row>
        </Rows>
    </Dataset>
</Root>

